---
source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
View daemon logs

Usage: mxr logs [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --no-follow
      --level <LEVEL>
      --since <SINCE>
      --search <SEARCH>  Free-text substring filter applied to each log line. Case-insensitive
      --limit <LIMIT>    Initial matching tail across retained logs (1..=10000). Default 200 [default: 200]
      --purge
      --dry-run          Preview the same owned-archive/event cutoff without deleting anything
      --format <FORMAT>  Output format. `json`/`jsonl` emit one JSON object per line with `{ timestamp, level, message, raw }` fields parsed from JSON or legacy text [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
